  "open_issues": [
    "thresholds come from one dusk; the switch back to day in the morning has not been observed",
    "in ADC mode a switch follows the reading within one check (no delay), so a lamp at night that lifts the reading above 150 brings day back at once",
    "the camera clock is not synced (no NTP), so switching by sun position or clock is not usable",
    "S94lightsensor works around majestic reading only /dev/ADC_CH0"
  ]
